&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles_content__YC4eT&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Head of Enterprise Marketing to build and lead HeyGen’s enterprise marketing motion, with an initial focus on helping us win the world’s largest and most strategic companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen already has significant organic adoption inside many of the world’s largest enterprises. Our next opportunity is to turn that awareness and usage into deep, strategic enterprise relationships — while proactively breaking into the high-value accounts we want to win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional B2B demand generation role focused on maximizing lead volume. You’ll partner closely with our enterprise sales team to identify the accounts that matter most and develop creative, highly targeted programs that help us engage the right buyers and buying committees within them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be the founding leader of this function, reporting to the CMO. You’ll start as a highly hands-on operator — developing strategy and personally executing programs — with the opportunity to build a team as the motion scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build our strategic account marketing engine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Enterprise Sales to develop and continuously refine our named-account strategy, account tiers, priority industries, and buying committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the ABM playbook for HeyGen from the ground up, defining how Marketing and Sales work together to penetrate and win our highest-value accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deep understanding of priority accounts, their business challenges, key stakeholders, existing HeyGen adoption, and signals of buying intent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create repeatable account planning and measurement systems that can scale as our enterprise business grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create programs that get us into the accounts that matter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop highly targeted campaigns across paid media, personalized digital experiences, executive programs, field marketing, gifting/direct mail, and other channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create personalized landing pages, pitches, demos, content, and experiences tailored to priority accounts and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive programs — including intimate dinners, roundtables, VIP events, and executive-to-executive engagement — that create meaningful relationships with senior enterprise buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop creative ways to surround entire buying committees, reaching champions, decision-makers, influencers, and stakeholders with messaging relevant to their role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment aggressively. Find unconventional ways to get the attention of difficult-to-reach enterprise buyers rather than relying on a standard B2B marketing playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn HeyGen’s existing adoption into an enterprise advantage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth, RevOps, Data, and Sales to identify companies already showing meaningful HeyGen adoption and product usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use first-party product signals to identify champions, understand account penetration, prioritize opportunities, and inform account-specific marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop programs that help convert organic product adoption into larger enterprise relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect our PLG and strategic-account motions so that Sales knows where HeyGen already has momentum inside the organizations they’re pursuing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as part of the enterprise GTM team, not as a separate marketing function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with enterprise leadership and AEs to understand what is blocking priority accounts and build marketing programs around those problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide targeted air cover around major opportunities as they progress through the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring account insights and market learnings back into our enterprise strategy and help shape where we focus next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand the motion over time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While our initial focus is strategic enterprise accounts, identify opportunities to apply what works to a broader set of enterprise and mid-market customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine which successful high-touch programs can become repeatable and scalable without sacrificing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the team, technology, agency relationships, and operating model required as enterprise marketing grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means HeyGen becomes dramatically better at penetrating and winning the enterprise accounts that matter most. Examples include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful growth in engagement and relationships across our highest-priority named accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More meetings and qualified opportunities created within strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased penetration of buying committees, rather than reliance on a single champion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic marketing programs that materially influence enterprise pipeline, deal progression, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tight operating rhythm between Sales and Marketing around shared account priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A repeatable ABM playbook that can eventually be scaled to a broader enterprise audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear understanding of which enterprise marketing investments actually move accounts — and doubling down aggressively on what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12+ years of B2B marketing experience, with meaningful experience marketing to large enterprise customers and several years operating at a senior leadership level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record building and executing account-based marketing / strategic account programs that generated measurable enterprise pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with high-ACV, complex enterprise sales motions involving multiple stakeholders and long sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern ABM tactics: targeted paid media, personalized content and experiences, executive programs, field marketing, direct mail/gifting, intent signals, and buying-committee engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely strong partnership instincts with Sales. You think in terms of shared accounts and shared revenue outcomes, not Marketing vs. Sales metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly creative marketer who can figure out how to get the attention of a Fortune 500 executive rather than simply running the standard B2B playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical enough to understand account signals, measure program effectiveness, and make disciplined decisions about where to invest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable spanning strategy and execution. You can present an enterprise marketing strategy to the leadership team in the morning and personally ship a campaign in the afternoon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with broader B2B demand generation is a plus. Over time, this role may expand beyond strategic accounts into more scalable enterprise and mid-market programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a function from an early stage and eventually hiring and leading a small, high-performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a fast-growing PLG company is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI-Native Mindset&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best operators today are AI-native.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should be deeply fluent in AI tools and comfortable using them to research accounts, understand buying committees, personalize campaigns, create content, analyze performance, and multiply your output. We’re looking for someone who sees AI not simply as something HeyGen sells, but as a fundamental part of how modern marketing should operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$200,000 – $250,000 + equity + benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers equity, comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at HeyGen and be part of a team that&#39;s reshaping the world of video creation through innovative technology!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is looking for a proactive, high-ownership IT Systems &amp;amp; Operations Owner to join our team in the Palo Alto, San Francisco or LA office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just close support tickets—you will own our IT infrastructure, security footprint, and physical workspace operations. You will act as the primary point of contact for all things IT, balancing immediate tactical unblocking with long-term strategic automation. As we scale, you will eventually manage external contractors to support day-to-day tasks, keeping your focus on architecture, cost optimization, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security &amp;amp; Endpoint Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Protection: Implement and oversee Data Loss Prevention (DLP) frameworks to safeguard company and customer data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Endpoint Security: Manage Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) tooling to monitor, detect, and mitigate workforce security threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access Control: Strictly execute technology onboarding and offboarding, ensuring zero-lag access revocation during departures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tooling, Licensing &amp;amp; Next-Gen IT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS Management: Provision, manage, and audit user access across our entire corporate software stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Workforce Administration: Manage the deployment and compliance of &quot;AI employees&quot; and automated workflows integrated into our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost Ownership: Act as a financial steward by auditing license utilization and identifying opportunities to optimize software spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Office Operations &amp;amp; Engineering Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace Infrastructure: Maintain physical office IT hardware, equipment, and conference room media setups in our Bay Area hubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-Leverage Support: Act as the strategic layer for employee onboarding infrastructure; guide teammates on setting up environments rather than troubleshooting basic helpdesk queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Implementation: Partner closely with our core engineering teams to test and deploy custom, internal IT automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Experience: 5+ years of experience in IT operations, systems administration, or a similar high-ownership IT role, preferably within a fast-scaling tech startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Foundation: Proven experience configuring and managing EDR systems and implementing DLP policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Project Management: Experience acting as a primary point of contact for vendors, with the demonstrated ability to eventually manage external contractors or support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Traits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Based in the San Francisco Bay Area&amp;nbsp; or LA with the ability to work regularly from the office to manage hardware and conference room infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for Action: You are obsessive about unblocking users quickly, prioritizing a seamless internal user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation Mindset: You look at every manual process and ask, &lt;em&gt;&quot;How can we make this self-serve?&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourcefulness: You know how to leverage internal software engineers to build solutions, while independently managing vendors and contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What HeyGen Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic and inclusive work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and advancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative culture that values innovation and creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the latest technologies and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;$120,000 – 180,000 annually&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is looking for a pragmatic, business-oriented Legal Counsel to join us. This role is ideal for an attorney with 3-6 years of legal experience, preferably advising high-growth SaaS or AI technology companies. You&#39;ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Security, Privacy and Finance, teams to help the company scale while managing legal risk in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for someone who enjoys solving complex commercial problems, is excited about emerging AI technologies, and wants to help shape legal strategy at a company building cutting-edge products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, negotiate, and advise on a wide variety of commercial agreements, including but not limited to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS subscription agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise customer agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Processing Agreements (DPAs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDAs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor and procurement agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership and reseller agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide practical legal advice to Sales teams to help close commercial transactions efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders on vendor negotiations and risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on privacy, data protection, security, intellectual property, AI governance, and regulatory issues arising in commercial transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, and Engineering, on product launches and AI-related initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and improve contract templates, negotiation playbooks, legal processes, and self-service tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal operations initiatives that improve efficiency and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the company’s IP portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor developments in AI, privacy, cybersecurity, and technology regulations and translate legal requirements into practical business guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with other corporate, compliance, and strategic legal projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. from an accredited law school.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active membership in at least one U.S. state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6 years of legal experience, including experience at a law firm and/or in-house legal department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating complex commercial agreements for technology or SaaS companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial contracting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data privacy principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual property&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent drafting, negotiation, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment with the ability to provide practical, solution-oriented advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in-house at a SaaS, cloud, or AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI products, foundation models, generative AI, or machine learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI-related regulatory frameworks, such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU AI Act&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;California AI legislation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI transparency and content authenticity standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with privacy frameworks such as GDPR, CCPA/CPRA, and global data transfer mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting procurement, vendor management, or strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who You Are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about emerging AI technologies and excited by the legal challenges they create.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable balancing legal risk with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and approachable, with a strong customer-service mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to simplify complex legal concepts for business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and capable of managing competing deadlines independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, proactive, and eager to improve processes rather than simply maintain them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to think on your feet, all the time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$220,000 – $280,000 + equity + benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers equity, comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at HeyGen and be part of a team that&#39;s reshaping the world of video creation through innovative technology!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Community Manager to help build and grow HeyGen’s online communities across forums, Discord, Reddit, and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in shaping how people connect with HeyGen and with each other. This means creating experiences that bring people in, give them a reason to stay, and make it easy for them to participate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re someone who enjoys both sides of the work. You come up with ideas that spark engagement, and you follow through to make sure they actually happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a thriving community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and manage HeyGen’s Discord with a focus on daily engagement and positive interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show up on Reddit in a way that feels natural, helpful, and relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with creators, contributors, and early advocates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help members feel seen, heard, and excited to participate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create engaging programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch campaigns like challenges, prompts, and showcases that encourage participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop recurring moments such as weekly threads, events, or creator spotlights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn product updates into opportunities for the community to explore and share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create simple, effective formats that make it easy for people to join in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep things running smoothly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day community activity across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and maintain a clear content and engagement rhythm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a safe, inclusive, and constructive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplify your community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highlight great work from users and share their stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encourage members to create and share content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify and grow community advocates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the feedback loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listen closely to what the community is saying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot trends, insights, and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share learnings with product and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how we engage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ year experience managing Discord and/or Reddit communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of what makes people engage and participate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of end-to-end community projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable being active in online communities and internet culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, thoughtful communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to balance creativity with execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and self-directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI, creator tools, or video platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HeyGen or similar products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic design skills (Canva, Figma, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running community campaigns or events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Developer communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What success looks like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Discord community that feels active, welcoming, and engaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Reddit presence that adds value and builds trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online spaces where both new creators and power users can find value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaigns that people want to participate in and share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online communities that drive business outcomes for a variety of internal teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pathways for members to become leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to work in-office, hybrid or remote while employed as a contractor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are looking to pay a c&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;ompetitive monthly rate on a long-term contract.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Expected range is $4,000 to $5,700/month&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us at HeyGen and help build the future of how people connect, create, and communicate through video.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd79dJeJGoYzuxxw3s4u9YTtsoh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_content__YC4eT&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles_description__uLHQ_&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd79dJeJGoYzuxxw3s4u9YTtsoh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQtBdkUnvo9w3ExV01NuCKOEs7f&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd79dJeJGoYzuxxw3s4u9YTtsoh&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen&#39;s marketing site is the first thing most people see of the product, and one of the highest-leverage growth surfaces we have. Every landing page, pricing page, and signup flow either turns curiosity into an activated user or loses them. We&#39;re hiring a Web Product Designer to own that surface end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a marketing-site role first, but not a brand or visual design role. We want someone who has done this work and has worked as a product designer, someone who thinks in funnels, ships experiments, reads the data, and iterates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own HeyGen&#39;s marketing surface end to end, working directly with Growth, Marketing, and Web Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join an elite design team with emphasis on ownership, speed and impact, where you decide what gets tested and not just how it looks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship to a site with enough traffic that a hypothesis gets answered in days, and build in code with AI as a core part of the workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Web Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design of HeyGen&#39;s marketing site from concept to production-ready spec. Homepage, product and feature pages, pricing, campaign landing pages, templates, SEO pages, and the handoff into signup and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Growth, Marketing, and Web Engineering as a true product partner rather than a ticket-taker. Help decide what to test, not just how it looks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and ship A/B tests and landing page variants. Form hypotheses, define success metrics, read the results, and carry the learnings forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion and Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve top-of-funnel conversion and the transition into the product through signup, first-run, and activation. Understand how the site connects to retention, not just clicks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept and Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality concept work, including exploratory directions, bold hero moments, motion, and storytelling that make the product feel as good as it is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile-First and Responsive:&lt;/strong&gt; Design mobile-first and responsive by default. Desktop and mobile are both first-class.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Use Claude Code, Codex, or equivalent tools as a core part of your workflow to prototype in code, explore more directions faster, and push designs to production quality without waiting on a handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Systems and Consistency:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and extend the site&#39;s design system so pages ship fast without eroding quality, and work with the broader design team to keep the site and the product feeling like one HeyGen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of designing and shipping modern software and web experiences. More is great. Less is fine if the work is exceptional and you&#39;re hungry, we care about output and drive more than a résumé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing marketing sites in production that had to perform, with a clear understanding of the difference between a page that looks good and a page that converts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as a product designer, embedded with PMs and engineers, shipping features and living with the consequences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of designing for metrics-driven outcomes, fluent in A/B testing, conversion rate, activation, retention, and top-of-funnel versus bottom-of-funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in visual design, with an insightful understanding of fundamental design elements like typography, layout, color, and motion, and the ability to take a blank canvas and bring a point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, building components and patterns rather than one-off pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in AI-assisted design. Very comfortable with Claude Code, Codex, or the equivalent, and able to get production-grade output from it, real shippable web pages rather than rough demos. You treat these tools as a multiplier on your craft and judgment, not a replacement for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile and responsive design as second nature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, high velocity, and iterating in public. We ship constantly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication. You can articulate why a design decision is right, and change your mind when the data says otherwise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-minded, self-driven, strong learner, constantly on the front edge of the industry, bringing the latest insights to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$180,000 – $235,000 annually depending on experience and fit. Not representative of total compensation which includes equity and benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers comprehensive benefits including internal equity, a matching 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Product Innovation with Advanced Computer Vision Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is a dynamic startup at the forefront of revolutionizing video content with state-of-the-art artificial intelligence technology. With a robust track record of growth and a proven business model, we are rapidly carving out a leadership position in the AI-powered video creation industry. We are in search of passionate Research Scientists with a specialization in Computer Vision to propel our mission forward. If you are eager to deploy your advanced skills to disrupt and redefine the video creation and interaction experience, your next big opportunity awaits with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied Innovation and Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Harness your knowledge of generative models, including GANs, Diffusion models, and other multi-modal models, to propel our video creation tools forward. Your role involves translating state-of-the-art research into innovative features that directly enhance our user experience and set our products apart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-World Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Channel your research capabilities to develop scalable solutions that have a significant impact on our platform, making the video creation process more intuitive, powerful, and accessible to our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Engineering and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage with a diverse team where collaborative efforts lead to extraordinary outcomes. Embrace an environment that promotes learning, mentorship, and teamwork, furthering both personal development and the advancement of our technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Master&#39;s or PhD in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of experience in machine learning and computer vision, demonstrating practical application of generative models and a passion for product-centric innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, with openness to other programming languages and tools as required by project demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with deep learning frameworks such as PyTorch, and a capacity for quickly mastering new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative spirit with a proven track record in a team-based research or development setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A lifelong learner with outstanding problem-solving skills and the ability to communicate effectively in a diverse team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What HeyGen Offers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Salary and Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a salary commensurate with your experience and a comprehensive benefits package that addresses a variety of needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative and Inclusive Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our workplace is designed to inspire innovation through collaboration, respect, and mutual support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunities for Advancement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional development, offering extensive opportunities for learning, mentorship, and career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dedication to Diversity:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;HeyGen is an equal opportunity employer, championing a diverse and inclusive team that ensures equal access to opportunities for all members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is building a modern, AI-native revenue motion where product usage and customer behavior inform how and when sales engage. We are looking for a Revenue Operations Lead&amp;nbsp; to take ownership of how revenue moves through HeyGen. This role focuses on building and maintaining the systems that power how we capture demand, qualify interest, and route high-value leads using inbound and product-driven signals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of product, data, and sales. You will be responsible for how revenue signals are defined, operationalized, and surfaced across the business, with a focus on inbound intake, qualification, and routing. We’re looking for someone with a solid strategic sales motion, fluent in modern GTM tooling, comfortable with system design, and willing to challenge existing patterns to build something better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity here is to define how revenue operations scale inside a high-growth AI company. This is a hands-on, systems-oriented role suited for someone who has built GTM Engineering foundations at a growing SaaS company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Head of Sales, you’ll have wide scope and visibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how inbound and product-driven revenue signals are captured, classified, and routed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define what constitutes sales-worthy intent and ensure those signals are acted on quickly and consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and data teams to operationalize behavioral and usage data for GTM use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain workflows for inbound intake, enrichment, scoring, and routing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure sales teams receive decision-ready context, not just lead objects, to engage effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain durable revenue workflows that scale as the business grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with data and engineering to integrate product behavior into GTM workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rationalize and evolve the GTM tooling and automation stack by deciding what to keep, consolidate, or deprecate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring in patterns, playbooks, or tools you&#39;ve seen work at high-growth SaaS or AI-native orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make systems legible, auditable, and able to scale cleanly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcomes You’ll Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inbound and product signals are captured and routed within minutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales trusts what appears in their pipeline and understands why it is there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The GTM motion responds dynamically to product behavior and user intent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow logic is clear, stable, and not fragmented across tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The revenue systems layer is modern, minimal, and built to support scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in Sales or Revenue analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building scoring, routing, and enrichment systems from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of CRM object modeling and routing logic — not just form-building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with modern GTM tooling and automation, including enrichment, outreach, scheduling, and scoring platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with product usage data, ideally sourced from a data warehouses or CDPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working directly with SQL, event streams, or data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to bring in best practices and frameworks, not just build what’s asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;$190,000 – $220,000 + equity + benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the salary information is a general guideline only.&amp;nbsp; HeyGen considers factors such as scope and responsibilities of the position, candidate&#39;s work experience, education/training, key skills, and internal equity, as well as location, market and business considerations when extending an offer.&amp;nbsp; As part of our total rewards package, HeyGen offers equity, comprehensive benefits including a 401k plan, health benefits, generous PTO, a parental leave program and emotional health resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HeyGen is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at HeyGen and be part of a team that&#39;s reshaping the world of video creation through innovative technology!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Security Engineer at HeyGen, you will own the security posture of one of the fastest-growing AI companies in the world. You will partner directly with engineering teams to ship secure features, harden our cloud infrastructure, and build the compliance and trust programs that unlock enterprise deals. This is a high-impact, high-autonomy role for an engineer who thinks in threat models and ships code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Infrastructure Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with engineering teams as an embedded security expert — writing code, reviewing architectures, and building secure application features and infrastructure components from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Detection &amp;amp; Remediation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement automated fraud detection systems to mitigate platform abuse, credential stuffing, and payment fraud. Partner with product and engineering to build real-time monitoring and rapid-response remediation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Vulnerability Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the strategy and execution for hardening our AWS/Python infrastructure. Build and run a robust vulnerability management program, including network security, cloud configuration, and remediation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as HeyGen&#39;s point person for AI and agentic system security. As we scale our agentic coding and AI agent products, you will ensure these rollouts are designed and deployed with strong security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRC &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee our SOC 2 compliance operations (currently managed via Drata) and annual audit cycles. Evaluate and roadmap future certifications, including ISO 27001, as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust &amp;amp; Safety Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide high-level oversight for platform abuse and content moderation (in partnership with growth and avatar teams), and serve as the escalation point for IT security incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering background with hands-on Python and AWS experience; you write code, not just policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience securing cloud infrastructure and applications — vulnerability management, network security, IAM, and secrets management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GRC frameworks and compliance programs (SOC 2, ISO 27001, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills: able to translate threat models for engineers, compliance requirements for auditors, and security architecture for enterprise CISOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and rapid scale; you prioritize ruthlessly and know when to build vs. buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern security tooling is a plus (Drata, Infisical, Bugcrowd, or equivalents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why HeyGen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massive Scale, Unique Problems:&lt;/strong&gt; We are protecting user identity at one of the fastest growth rates in SaaS history. The security engineering challenges here are genuinely novel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed with Guardrails:&lt;/strong&gt; Our security philosophy is not about saying &quot;no.&quot; It is about building guardrails that let the engineering team ship fast without introducing unacceptable risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mature Tooling from Day One:&lt;/strong&gt; We already run Drata for GRC, Infisical for secrets management, and a private bug bounty program via Bugcrowd. You are not starting from zero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy and Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You will have the visibility and resources to shape HeyGen&#39;s entire security roadmap. Small team, big mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HeyGen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HeyGen, our mission is to make visual storytelling accessible to all. Over the last decade, visual content has become the preferred method of information creation, consumption, and retention. But the ability to create such content, in particular videos, continues to be costly and challenging to scale. Our ambition is to build technology that equips more people with the power to reach, captivate, and inspire audiences.&lt;br&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.heygen.com&quot;&gt;www.heygen.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Visit our Mission and Culture doc &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JQ6k6Ce8VRE60zO09Uc94JVaxRWA2xC1-IbIFAAHPvs/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;545&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;Software Engineer, Dev Productivity&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work at the intersection of software development, automation, and infrastructure. Your mission is to streamline engineering workflows, optimize CI/CD systems, build and testing infrastructure, and enhance developer tooling to accelerate software delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;953&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain high-performance &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt; pipelines to improve development speed and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;954&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot;&gt;Develop internal tools and automation to reduce friction in engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1110&quot;&gt;Optimize &lt;strong&gt;build and test infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; for faster feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Work closely with engineering teams to identify and eliminate inefficiencies in the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1319&quot;&gt;Enhance and monitor developer environments to improve developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Advocate for best practices in software development, version control, and release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;Drive the adoption of automation and tooling that increase engineering efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1632&quot; data-end=&quot;1735&quot;&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt; tools like GitHub Actions, Jenkins, GitLab CI, Buildkite, or CircleCI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1806&quot; data-end=&quot;1875&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;build systems&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Bazel, CMake, Make, Gradle).&lt;/li&gt;
